2026-07-27T10:22:00.2243879Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:22:00.2244429Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:22:00.2244878Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:22:00.2245577Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:22:00.2246958Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:22:00.2257681Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
